# Deal update posts

When the user is already signed into X in the Cursor browser, draft and publish from that browser session. Do not start an X plugin login or any other X authentication.

# Deal update graphics

When the user asks for a social post or update about this deal list and wants a graphic, make a clean 16:9 image in this style and show it before posting.

- Dark navy background (`#07142B`) and a thin electric-blue vertical bar on the left.
- One large white headline, then a short light-blue subtitle, then two or three white lines for the deals being highlighted.
- Flat type only. No photos, logos, fake UI, watermarks, URLs, or corner captions.
- Put the deal count in the headline when the update is about the list size.
- Match the post: only the deals named in the copy, with the price or discount, nothing else.
